    {
     "type": "text-editor",
     "id": "474d76cb",
     "text": "Navels Are hybrids that were the result of crossing a tangelo and a mandarin orange which make them deliciously sweet, it resembles a human navel (bellybutton)—hence the name. They are seedless, are easy to peel, and are thought to be one of the world’s best-tasting oranges.",
     "html": "<h3> <span><b>Navels </b><br/></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;\"> <span>Are hybrids that were the result of crossing a tangelo and a mandarin orange which make them deliciously sweet, it resembles a human navel (bellybutton)—hence the name. They are seedless, are easy to peel, and are thought to be one of the world’s  best-tasting oranges.<br/></span></span></h3>"
    },
